    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make a Mississippi slugburger, a delicious and unusual depression recipe. Unlike other burgers, the slugburger mixes ground chuck together with bread crumbs and seasons it with salt, pepper, garlic powder, and onion powder. After cooking over the stove, top it with cayenne and chili powder. It’s crusty, crunchy, and makes for a delicious dish for lunch or dinner!",
